:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Guile (Enemy)]].''
'''Guile''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 513
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Guile
|name2 = Guile CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Guile CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Guile, at first glance, appears to be a great [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] crowd-controller due to applying status effects and also tanking them. Unfortunately, that is the only thing he's useful for, as his stats are nothing special. [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] are able to do the same things he can do against Floating enemies, and they are more spammable than him, meaning he will not be used as much. Overall, a decent generalist, but will not be used often if you have better [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]].

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Tanker}}

